[00:13.60]1. Great God, Jehovah, boundless in might,
[00:23.98]You have made known your love of right.
[00:30.88]Badness prevails on earth below,
[00:36.82]Causing us pain, as you well know.
[00:43.68]You are not slow, as men may contend;
[00:50.52]Your time is near for patience to end.
[00:57.42](Chorus)
[00:58.40]We look ahead with hope renewed,
[01:04.22]Praising your name in deep gratitude.
[01:25.62]2. One thousand years, from your point of view,
[01:32.46]Are like a day when they are through.
[01:39.38]Time now proceeds to your great day;
[01:46.10]It will arrive without delay.
[01:53.06]Though all transgression you do resent,
[01:59.02]Your heart is glad when sinners repent.
[02:05.92](Chorus)
[02:06.92]We look ahead with hope renewed,
[02:13.60]Praising your name in deep gratitude.
